From: anyingiit <49945850+anyingiit@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 20:43:34 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(zb_io): link Frameworks into the prefix

Homebrew links a keg's Frameworks directory into the prefix: the
Foo.framework bundle and its Versions directory are created as real
directories and shared between kegs, everything below them is linked
as a whole. zerobrew left Frameworks out of LINK_DIRS, so Python's
framework build on macOS never showed up in the prefix's Frameworks.

Closes #414
---
